      "seed": 1001,
      "zIndex": 1,
      "text": "🦀 DESKTOP (Rust Modular Architecture)\n\n📂 src/core/\n  • config.rs (CLI & Runtime settings)\n  • state.rs (Global App Coordinator)\n\n📂 src/connection/ (Control Plane Gateway)\n  • session.rs (1-Device-at-a-time Lease Lock)\n  • discovery.rs (UDP Beacon :8082)\n  • router.rs (Axum Route & Gatekeeper)\n  • heartbeat.rs (1s Ping/Pong Keepalive)\n\n📂 src/services/speaker/ (Independent Data Plane)\n  • mod.rs (Lifecycle & Broadcast Bus)\n  • capture.rs (WASAPI Loopback Capture)\n  • downmix.rs & resample.rs (48 kHz PCM)\n  • protocol.rs (20-byte LAUD v1 Framing)\n  • handler.rs (/ws/speaker WebSocket Sink)\n\n📂 src/gui/ (Native Win32 UI Layer)\n  • window.rs (HWND, Win32 Controls)\n  • views/vu_meter.rs (GDI Stereo Meters)\n  • state_bridge.rs (Reactive State Observer)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": "Consolas, monospace",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_network_bridge",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 200,
