      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "seed": 1002,
      "zIndex": 1,
      "text": "⚡ DECOUPLED CONTRACTS\n\n1. UDP Discovery (:8082)\n   LAUD_DISCOVER ⟷ LAUD_HERE\n\n2. Session Gatekeeper (:8080)\n   Single-Device Lease Token\n\n3. Dedicated Speaker Stream\n   /ws/speaker\n   (Zero cross-talk with input/ui)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": "Inter, sans-serif",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
    {
      "id": "node_android_tree",
