      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "seed": 1003,
      "zIndex": 1,
      "text": "📱 MOBILE (Android Kotlin Feature Modules)\n\n📂 com.vessel.core/\n  • model/ (ConnectionState, DeviceInfo)\n  • di/ (Service Locator / State Singleton)\n\n📂 com.vessel.connection/ (Client Session)\n  • DiscoveryClient.kt (Hotspot UDP Broadcaster)\n  • ConnectionManager.kt (Session Handshake)\n  • HeartbeatMonitor.kt (Drop Detection)\n\n📂 com.vessel.features.speaker/ (Self-Contained)\n  • SpeakerManager.kt (Audio Lifecycle)\n  • AudioWebSocket.kt (Client for /ws/speaker)\n  • LaudParser.kt (Header & CRC Validator)\n  • JitterBuffer.kt (Adaptive Micro-Slew)\n  • AudioPlayer.kt (AudioTrack 48kHz Stereo)\n\n📂 com.vessel.ui/ (Reactive MVVM UI Layer)\n  • MainActivity.kt (Clean Single-Screen Host)\n  • MainViewModel.kt (StateFlow Observables)\n  • components/ (Pulsing Button & Drawer)",
